`secrets` (secrets.toml.age): 2 group(s), 3 record(s)
groups:
  agents   1 recipient(s)  🔒 not a member
  default  1 recipient(s)  opens
records:
  CF_API_TOKEN      env_var  agents 🔒  2026-09-18T00:00:00.000Z  dns and workers
  OPENAI_API_KEY    env_var  default    2026-09-18T00:00:00.000Z  billing account
  dkim-example-com           default    2026-09-18T00:00:00.000Z  the signing key
